<title>POLAND: GERMANY'S BITBURGER BUYS SMALL POLISH BREWER - PAP.</title>
<headline>GERMANY'S BITBURGER BUYS SMALL POLISH BREWER - PAP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Bitburger Th. Simon GmbH bought 95 percent of a small Polish brewery in the Western border town of Szczecin, PAP news agency reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said that Bitburger planned to expand anual beer output of Browar Szczecin SA to about 600,000 hectolitres from its 1996 production of 330,000 hectolitres.</p>
<p>No financial details were given.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
